## Leaf notes (symbol / file extraction)

Hundreds of notes name symbols or files (e.g. `Login.tsx.md`, `balances.ts.md`). **Resolve Obsidian wikilinks** by treating `[[Some Name]]` as the file `obsidian/Some Name.md` when present.

**Truth ordering:** For implementation and APIs, prefer **`Collect-RX-main/src`** and **OUTSTANDING**. Many vault paths point at older or parallel trees (see `CLAUDE.md`); use vault for **relationships, exploration, and module intent**, not as the only source of file paths.

